<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n31584" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἑκάς</span></b> , Adv.
		<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>afar, far off,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Il.
				20.422
			</span></i>, etc.; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οὐχ ἑκάς που</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					S.
					<u>Ph.</u>
					41
				</span></i>
			 ; rare in Prose, <i><span class="en">
				Th.
				1.69
			</span></i>,<i><span class="en">
				80
			</span></i> (and later, Nic.Dam.<i><span class="en">
				p.6D.
			</span></i>) : c. gen., <i>far from, far away from,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἑ. Ἄργεος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					9.246
				</span></i>
			, etc.: freq. following its case, <i><span class="en">
				13.263
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Od.
				14.496
			</span></i>, al.; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οὐ Χαρίτων ἑ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pi.
					<u>P.</u>
					8.21
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>Ph.</u>
				907
			</span></i> ; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἑ. ἀπὸ τείχεος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					18.256
				</span></i>
			 ; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀπὸ τῆς νήσου ἑ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hdt.
					3.41
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			
				Comp.
			
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἑκαστέρω</span>”
				<i>farther,</i>
				 <i><span class="en">
					Od.
					7.321
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				<u>h.Bacch.</u>
				29
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Alc.
				<u>Supp.</u>
				5.8
			</span></i>(<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐκ-</span>), <i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				6.108
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>HF</u>
				1047
			</span></i> (lyr.), etc.: c. gen., <i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				2.169
			</span></i>, al. ; also <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἑκαστοτέρω</span>
			dub. in <i><span class="en">
				Theoc.
				15.7
			</span></i> : 
				Sup.
			
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἑκαστάτω</span>”
				<i>farthest,</i>
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					10.113
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				4.33
			</span></i> : c. gen., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τοὺς ἑωυτῶν ἑ. οἰκημένους</span>”
				<i>farthest from..,</i>
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					1.134
				</span></i>
			 ; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τῆς Λιβύης ἑ. ἦλθε</span>
			<i>to the farthest point</i> of Libya, <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				4.204
			</span></i>, cf.<i><span class="en">
				9.14
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> of Time,
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἑ. ἐών</span>
			<i>afar,</i> i.e. <i>long after,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Pi.
				<u>P.</u>
				2.54
			</span></i> ; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οὐχ ἑ. χρόνου</span> in no
				<i>long</i> time, <i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				8.144
			</span></i> ; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οὐχ ἑ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					A.
					<u>Ag.</u>
					1650
				</span></i>
			. [<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ᾰ ; ᾱ</span> only in <i><span class="en">
				Call.
				<u>Ap.</u>
				2
			</span></i>, in arsi.] (Prob. from <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἕ</span>
			and <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-κάς</span> as in <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀνδρακάς</span> ; lit. 'by himself'.)</div>
